    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94894" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῐο-ειδής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shadowy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιοειδέα φῦλ᾽ ἀμενηνά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					686
				</span></i>
			 (mockheroic); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. φαντάσματα</span>”
